Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.01,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Great play, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.83,0:01:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You wiped out Weevil's army\Nin one move. Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.25,0:01:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got him on the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. Huh? My!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.55,0:01:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You losers don't seem to realize\Nwho your little pal is up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil's regional champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.55,0:01:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got moves your shrimp\Ncouldn't even dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.09,0:01:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always butting\Nin with her big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not gonna let\Nher trash my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.39,0:01:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody asked you, so why\Ndon't you just take a hike?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And miss the chance to watch\Na champion like Weevil?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.47,0:01:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he turned this around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.69,0:01:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, Weevil really came\Nfrom behind to win the regionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.77,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's tough and sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.23,0:01:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose side are you two\Ngoofballs on, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is, for Yugi,\Nthis is his first official duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's fighting a champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.09,0:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:01:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you know so much,\Nbut Yugi will show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have flattened my army of\Nbugs, Yugi, but you haven't won.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I have plenty of tricks up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.07,0:02:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done an awful lot of\Nbuzzing throughout this whole duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.95,0:02:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, but I'm still here\Nwaiting for the sting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.71,0:02:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're new to this whole\Ndueling tournament thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.71,0:02:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to make this simple for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.31,0:02:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna wipe that goofy\Ngrin from your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see which lucky bug\Ngets to take the first bite
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.91,0:02:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but this little bug won't stand a chance\Nagainst all your ferocious monsters Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play him in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That would have been a nice\Nbluff But I still haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.83,0:02:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,forgotten about the trap card\Nyou played With this trap card,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.79,0:02:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,you will be able to attack\Nme with any of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't trap me then, and\Nhe's not going to trap me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil's trap card will activate\Nas soon as I call an attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.35,0:03:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and it'll destroy all the\Nmonsters I have on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if I get my monsters off the field\Nfirst, and then destroy Weevil's trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.53,0:03:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll spring your trap, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, the monster recovery card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to call back all the\Ncreatures I have on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.57,0:03:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters, return to your cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your trap has nothing to snare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And once my monsters are\Nall safely back in my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the recovery card also\Nlets me draw a new hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all I have to do is sacrifice\None of my weaker monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and your trap is sprung.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Trap cards only work when\Nthey catch you by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, don't give your plan away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a bee's behind\Nabout that stupid trap. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I tricked you into recalling your\Nmonsters so you couldn't attack this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a simple little larva moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.31,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That tiny creature can't\Nbe much of a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Weevil up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.47,0:04:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, he's just a little slug now, but the\Ncocoon of evolution will change all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.51,0:04:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ew, that's just gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil's bug is sealing\Nitself in a cocoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.63,0:04:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I told those chumps Weevil\Nwould turn this duel around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.27,0:04:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold my cocoon of evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Within that cocoon sits\Nmy tiny little larva moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And over the next five turns he will\Nundergo a startling transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,From harmless caterpillar\Nto unstoppable great moth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll crack your\Ncocoon before that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.31,0:05:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Easier said than done, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,for my cocoon of evolution\Nalso gets a field
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.41,0:05:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,power bonus from the wilderness around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,increasing its defense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be so strong, you won't even\Nbe able to scratch its surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just five more turns, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,In five turns, my great moth will\Nfully evolve and finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If what Weevil says is\Ntrue, I better act fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.09,0:05:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's getting bigger and\Nstronger with each passing second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to\Nbreak open that cocoon now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that moth get to\Nits fifth stage of evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But do I have a card that's\Nstrong enough to stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia, the fierce knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shatter that cocoon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.13,0:06:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The field power bonus makes it too strong.\NThat's one turn down. Care to try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil's cocoon is going to be tough to\Ncrack And for each attack that fails,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My life points go down! Oh no! Hang\Ntough, Yugi! You'll pop that puss bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think you're laughing\Nat all that stupid cheerleading
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.23,0:06:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you're doing you make it sound\Nlike your Yugi still has a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, of course he does
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to it Taya any\Nduelist that's ever gone up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,against weevil's cocoon of\Nevolution has been totally trashed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But Yugi's got us to\Nhelp him beat it. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll need a whole lot more than you losers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it's growing the more time you\Nwaste the more powerful it becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't come up with something quick,\NI'm not just going to lose this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:07:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lose my only chance\Nto save my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tick-tock, tick-tock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just four more turns until\Nmy ultimate insect emerges.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.85,0:07:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can stop worrying about\Nhow you're going to destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.99,0:07:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it and start worrying about\Nhow it's going to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.95,0:07:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should prepare a defense in\Ncase I really can't stop that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.83,0:07:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No defense will save your life\Npoints once my moth is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to figure out a way\Nto turn this duel around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil's pretty confident that whatever's\Ngrowing in that cocoon is unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's gotta be some way to pop that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.89,0:07:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,thing open and wipe that\Nsmirk off his face. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.59,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta win this for your grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.73,0:07:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can't keep letting this\Nlittle creep push you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you gotta get fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So do you guys sit around and\Nwork up these lame cheers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,or do they just come to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you realize that your pep talk\Nnonsense only distracts Yugi from the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet no one's ever even\Nwanted to be your friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone care enough to cheer you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.99,0:08:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends haven't helped Yugi any.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.27,0:08:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.05,0:08:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.01,0:08:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Mai, from the look on Yugi's face,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say that having friends\Njust did help him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Brat, what possible idea could Yugi\Nhave gotten from these mental morons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Curse of Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Take flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll combine it with this magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with Dragonflame!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You know your little firefly\Ncan't hurt my cocoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.85,0:09:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever said I was aiming for your cocoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.59,0:09:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I combined my burning land\Nmagic card with my curse
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,of dragon to destroy the\Nforest all around your cocoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I lose my field power bonus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cocoon was too\Ntough to attack directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.59,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But without its field power\Nbonus, it's just a big target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.53,0:09:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.45,0:09:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia, the Fierce Knight, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Topped it open like a zit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,still moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.61,0:10:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have evolved enough to\Nsurvive. I told you evil was good. I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.13,0:10:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,impressed that you kissed my cocoon\Nyuki but still you were unable to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,stop the evolution of my ultimate\Ninsect the great moth but i thought
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.57,0:10:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it took five turns so you stopped\Nhim one turn early he's still strong
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to beat you. Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed that the little\Ndweebs aren't cheering now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.03,0:10:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The great moth is an unbeatable creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They can chatter from the sidelines\Nall they want, but it won't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.03,0:10:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,help Yugi one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.45,0:10:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We will turn this match around\Nonce more, but I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So Yugi feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.21,0:10:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,outclassed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you're enjoying your\Nfirst major league dueling loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.97,0:11:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have gotten your prized\Nmonster onto the field, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll still find a way to\Nsquash that oversized bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that stinging\Njab with your life points. Duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Moth, take flight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.23,0:11:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll settle this in the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's dragon is no\Nmatch for my Great Moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and none of his land monsters have\Nthe ability to attack me in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But which puny creature\Nshall I obliterate first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's high time I pay back your\Nknight for demolishing my cocoon. My knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the heart of my attack force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can afford to lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.51,0:11:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.93,0:11:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My great moth will crush your defenses,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,slay your knight, and blast\Nyour dragon from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.39,0:11:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:11:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Moth, hurricane attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.36,0:12:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my beaver warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stand against the gale\Nforce winds of my moth hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Your night will be totally blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.57,0:12:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll teach him to mess with my cocoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.53,0:12:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't count on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, you were so busy\Nfawning over your moth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,you didn't notice I played\Na polymerization card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.61,0:12:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have two compatible\Nmonsters on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use my polymerization card and\Nfuse them into one ultimate creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not some beginner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what fusion does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must know it\Nincreases my attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.65,0:12:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My fused dragon knight\Ncombo is now powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,enough to go head to head\Nwith your great moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure\Nabout that. Look again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:12:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My knight, he's losing points, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But how, and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.39,0:13:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's poison, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison particles from my great moth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Each time it uses its hurricane attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.73,0:13:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,it releases tons of these\Ntiny toxic particles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And your precious dragon knight combo\Nis being poisoned by their deadly touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My knight is losing points\Nwith each passing second
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do I protect him\Nagainst the very air itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like my poison particles\Nare taking their toll, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,my knight's really in serious trouble\NAnd there's nothing here in my
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,hand that can help him But I know\Nmy grandpa's deck won't let me down
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ready to be rained out, Weevil?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Machu, the magical mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.55,0:14:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My poison. You're washing\Nit all away. That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,magical mist washes the\Nfield clean No fair,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to win And you saved\Nyourself with a little drizzle It's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved my night But that's\Nnot all I did Alright then,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you may have stopped my poison attack But
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.23,0:14:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you've only\Nwon a brief reprieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Because my next move is one you won't\Nbe able to think your way out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself for my ultimate\Ninsect's ultimate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Moth, Tornado of Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.55,0:14:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little rainstorm didn't save\Nyou from that one, now did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your night is toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.47,0:14:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're almost out of life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come back from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.77,0:14:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Joey's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:14:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi never gives up, and we never\Ngive up on him. You're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil has totally annihilated\NYugi's strongest monster combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.95,0:15:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's down to 50 measly life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't win, so do me a\Nfavor and stop yapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop yapping, you selfish, pompous,\Nbleach-blonde, know-it-all win bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do us a favor and get lost, right, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.05,0:15:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ignore her, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'd be great if we could\Ntrade Mai in for life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.25,0:15:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you all along Yugi never\Nhad a chance at winning this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He wastes too much of his\Ntime listening to you losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.63,0:15:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil keeps his mind on the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't he see this coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,See what coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is Yugi's grinning about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.87,0:15:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.99,0:15:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a big smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.69,0:15:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.05,0:15:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so happy about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that snickering!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, I know it will be very difficult\Nfor you to accept losing a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.17,0:16:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially after spending so much time\Nfinding inventive ways to cheat But
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,if you thought bending the rules would\Nhelp you win this match You're wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a trick You play\Ndishonestly so you expect
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.51,0:16:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the same of your opponents\NBut I duel with Honor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil and that makes all\Nthe difference You got
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.39,0:16:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Here's what I've got.\NThe mighty Summoned Skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ultimate insect won't\Nwithstand my next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.81,0:16:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi must be losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,His summoned skull is strong, but\Nmy great moth is stronger still.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:16:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's foolish enough to attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:17:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,my monster will most certainly\Nsquish his monster and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,wipe out the rest of Yugi's\Nprecious life points as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something you overlooked, Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.91,0:17:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My magical mist is still\Ndampening this entire field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My great morph is totally soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And my summoned skull\Nattacks with electricity,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.55,0:17:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,making your waterlogged bug\Na giant-sized lightning rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're in the\Nmood for some fireworks,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.26,0:17:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,because all this water boosts my monster's\Nelectrical attack by 1,000 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.27,0:17:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.21,0:18:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My morph's unbeatable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yugi! Way to go! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.33,0:18:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You won!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you would!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think Yugi\Ncould ever beat Weevil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm the regional champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The regional champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, but you only won your\Nduels through lying and cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,True champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They play with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They play fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your breath\Non this sneaky slug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a dueling disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hereby relieve him\Nof his dueling gauntlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.57,0:18:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Three star chips so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I still need to win seven more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.83,0:19:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten starships will gain me entry into\Nthat castle where they're holding
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,My grandfather prisoner, and where\NI'll battle Pegasus once and for all.
